{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794589484965,"sessionID":"ses_e2a23ef3effefsOEWT56TDWh7U","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5de613a00176XLbpJkKGGAn5","sessionID":"ses_e2a23ef3effefsOEWT56TDWh7U","messageID":"msg_1d5de45be0010DR422hQZBgzc8","type":"tool","id":"call_ea8c2e31ac664dbfb7468b42","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"<!-- MANUAL_PLAYBOOK_RESULT_PERSISTENCE_CONTRACT -->\nA scenario run is complete only after its `PASS`, `FAIL` or `SKIP` outcome, its reason and its evidence paths are recorded by hand in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/benchmark/reports/<dated-run-label>/`. The first recorded run creates that folder, because the wrapper that once wrote these records was retired and no renderer writes them now.","oldString":"<!-- MANUAL_PLAYBOOK_RESULT_PERSISTENCE_CONTRACT -->\nA scenario run is complete only after its `PASS`, `FAIL`, or `SKIP` outcome and reason are recorded into `system-skill-advisor/benchmark/reports/<dated-run-label>/`. Generated report Markdown is renderer-owned and never hand-authored.","path":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\n@@ -26,9 +26,9 @@\n \n ### Result persistence\n \n <!-- MANUAL_PLAYBOOK_RESULT_PERSISTENCE_CONTRACT -->\n-A scenario run is complete only after its `PASS`, `FAIL`, or `SKIP` outcome and reason are recorded into `system-skill-advisor/benchmark/reports/<dated-run-label>/`. Generated report Markdown is renderer-owned and never hand-authored.\n+A scenario run is complete only after its `PASS`, `FAIL` or `SKIP` outcome, its reason and its evidence paths are recorded by hand in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/benchmark/reports/<dated-run-label>/`. The first recorded run creates that folder, because the wrapper that once wrote these records was retired and no renderer writes them now.\n \n ---\n \n ## 1. OVERVIEW\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"<!-- MANUAL_PLAYBOOK_RESULT_PERSISTENCE_CONTRACT -->\\nA scenario run is complete only after its `PASS`, `FAIL` or `SKIP` outcome, its reason and its evidence paths are recorded by hand in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/benchmark/reports/<dated-run-label>/`. The first recorded run creates that folder, because the wrapper that once wrote these records was retired and no renderer writes them now.\",\"oldString\":\"<!-- MANUAL_PLAYBOOK_RESULT_PERSISTENCE_CONTRACT -->\\nA scenario run is complete only after its `PASS`, `FAIL`, or `SKIP` outcome and reason are recorded into `system-skill-advisor/benchmark/reports/<dated-run-label>/`. Generated report Markdown is renderer-owned and never hand-authored.\",\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794589483322,"end":1794589484965}}}}
